<title>UK: GUS shares fall as sell orders weigh.</title>
<headline>GUS shares fall as sell orders weigh.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Great Universal Stores Plc (GUS) fell on Tuesday after a few large sell orders weighed on the stock, market-makers said.</p>
<p>GUS shares were 14p weaker at 627-1/2 by by 1056 GMT.</p>
<p>&quot;They started well enough but there was a lot of stock washing around after a couple of sell orders and that pushed it lower,&quot; one market-maker said. &quot;But we've seen some bargain-hunters coming in now and it seems to be stabilising.&quot;</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
